# GraphQL Go / Platform API

- Platform API is Go + GraphQL (gqlgen). Schema is the contract; resolvers stay thin.
- This service is **Icerde**, not the customer's generated backend.
- Auth, orgs, devices, jobs, LLM versions, and audit logs go here.
- Do not expose raw Mongo documents. Map to GraphQL types.
- Mutations that change security or LLM routing must write an audit event.
- Errors: user-safe messages to the client; details only in logs. No stack traces in GraphQL.
- Health may be a tiny HTTP endpoint. Everything else is GraphQL.
- Read [docs/backend-graphql.md](docs/backend-graphql.md) before adding types or resolvers.
